[sliver] These are the explicit 0.9 mm lip tips, 1.2 mm engagement faces and 1.5 mm wing ends of the shared snap interface, not remnants of intersecting solids. The 4 mm part changes the bore while keeping that interface. Release force and endurance on this article are unmeasured.
alternatives: Thicker lip tips or wings change the catch/window engagement and spring motion. Removing these faces removes capture; a zip-tie closure is the available different construction, used for flavor B.
