[thin] The 1.499 mm mesh reading measures the nominal 1.5 mm spring wings. Their explicit exception supplies the lateral travel for 1.2 mm catch engagement. It is not a wall minimum, force or lifetime qualification for the assembled appliance.
alternatives: Increasing wing thickness changes its spring response and the mating flank clearance. Increasing the whole latch requires a corresponding rib/window revision; the zip-tie construction avoids the spring and is used at flavor B.
